# The warehouse example's entry module. It loads an order from a table into a
# list, prices it two ways at once (two tasks borrow the same list), prints both
# totals, writes a one-line report file, and reads the report back.
#
# Exit codes: 0 done, 2 a line has a negative quantity, 3 the order is empty,
# 4 the report file could not be written or read, 5 standard output failed.

warehouse is module
warehouse purpose "Price an order at list price and with a bulk discount, then write and read back a report"
warehouse path warehouse
warehouse imports standard.console
warehouse imports standard.fs
warehouse imports standard.string
warehouse imports standard.time
warehouse imports pricing
warehouse exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter scope none

reportFiles is capability
reportFiles purpose "Authority to write and read files in the working directory whose names start with warehouse-"
reportFiles grants write fs.files
reportFiles grants read fs.files
reportFiles scope "warehouse-*"

order is table
order purpose "The order to price, one row per line"
order of pricing.LineItem
order row widget 1
order row gadget 2
order row gizmo 3
order cell widget sku 101
order cell widget quantity 4
order cell widget unitCents 250
order cell gadget sku 102
order cell gadget quantity 2
order cell gadget unitCents 1200
order cell gizmo sku 103
order cell gizmo quantity 10
order cell gizmo unitCents 35

main is operation
main purpose "Price the order both ways, print the totals, and write and read back a report"
main invariant none
main typeParam none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwner none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main effect write fs.files
main effect read fs.files
main uses stdoutWriter
main uses reportFiles
main memory heap true
main async true
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label fill loopKind forEach
main label fill within none
main label fill maxIterations 3
main label fill over order
main label addRow loopKind none
main label addRow within fill
main label price loopKind none
main label price within none
main label joinDiscount loopKind none
main label joinDiscount within none
main label stopDiscount loopKind none
main label stopDiscount within none
main label printTotals loopKind none
main label printTotals within none
main label printSecond loopKind none
main label printSecond within none
main label compose loopKind none
main label compose within none
main label checkOld loopKind none
main label checkOld within none
main label createNew loopKind none
main label createNew within none
main label opened loopKind none
main label opened within none
main label readBack loopKind none
main label readBack within none
main label decode loopKind none
main label decode within none
main label showReport loopKind none
main label showReport within none
main label finished loopKind none
main label finished within none
main label listFailed loopKind none
main label listFailed within none
main label discountFailed loopKind none
main label discountFailed within none
main label readFailed loopKind none
main label readFailed within none
main label badLine loopKind none
main label badLine within none
main label noLines loopKind none
main label noLines within none
main label fileFailed loopKind none
main label fileFailed within none
main label outputFailed loopKind none
main label outputFailed within none
main let reportPath immutable String "warehouse-report.txt"
main let listLabel immutable String "list="
main let discountLabel immutable String " discounted="
main let waitMs immutable Int64 5000
main let readLimit immutable Int64 256
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main let badLineCode immutable ExitCode 2
main let emptyCode immutable ExitCode 3
main let fileCode immutable ExitCode 4
main let outputCode immutable ExitCode 5
main at begin do makeDeadline
main at begin do makeLines
main at begin goto fill
main at fill branch ifNext order bind row pricing.LineItem goto addRow else goto price
main at addRow do appendRow
main at addRow goto fill
main at price start listTask
main at price start discountTask
main at price join listTask
main at price branch ifError listTask goto stopDiscount else goto joinDiscount
main at joinDiscount join discountTask
main at joinDiscount branch ifError discountTask goto discountFailed else goto printTotals
main at stopDiscount cancel discountTask
main at stopDiscount join discountTask
main at stopDiscount branch ifError discountTask goto listFailed else goto listFailed
main at printTotals do printList
main at printTotals branch ifError printList goto outputFailed else goto printSecond
main at printSecond do printDiscount
main at printSecond branch ifError printDiscount goto outputFailed else goto compose
main at compose do listDigits
main at compose do discountDigits
main at compose do joinListLabel
main at compose do joinDiscountLabel
main at compose do joinDiscountDigits
main at compose do lineBytes
main at compose do removeOld
main at compose branch ifError removeOld goto checkOld else goto createNew
main at checkOld match removeError fs.FileError
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.notFound bind none none goto createNew
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.denied bind none none goto fileFailed
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.exists bind none none goto fileFailed
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.tooLarge bind none none goto fileFailed
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.timedOut bind none none goto fileFailed
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.cancelled bind none none goto fileFailed
main at checkOld case fs.FileError.failed bind removeCode Int32 goto fileFailed
main at createNew do openReport
main at createNew branch ifError openReport goto fileFailed else goto opened
main at opened defer closeReportCleanup
main at opened start writeReport
main at opened join writeReport
main at opened branch ifError writeReport goto fileFailed else goto readBack
main at readBack start readReport
main at readBack join readReport
main at readBack branch ifError readReport goto readFailed else goto decode
main at decode do decodeReport
main at decode branch ifError decodeReport goto fileFailed else goto showReport
main at showReport do printReport
main at showReport branch ifError printReport goto outputFailed else goto finished
main at finished return ok okCode
main at listFailed match listError pricing.PricingError
main at listFailed case pricing.PricingError.negativeQuantity bind listSku Int64 goto badLine
main at listFailed case pricing.PricingError.emptyOrder bind none none goto noLines
main at discountFailed match discountError pricing.PricingError
main at discountFailed case pricing.PricingError.negativeQuantity bind discountSku Int64 goto badLine
main at discountFailed case pricing.PricingError.emptyOrder bind none none goto noLines
main at readFailed match readError fs.FileError
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.notFound bind none none goto fileFailed
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.denied bind none none goto fileFailed
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.exists bind none none goto fileFailed
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.tooLarge bind none none goto fileFailed
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.timedOut bind none none goto fileFailed
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.cancelled bind none none goto fileFailed
main at readFailed case fs.FileError.failed bind osCode Int32 goto fileFailed
main at badLine return ok badLineCode
main at noLines return ok emptyCode
main at fileFailed return ok fileCode
main at outputFailed return ok outputCode

store is region
store in main
store strategy arena
store capacity 65536
store released atReturn

makeDeadline is call
makeDeadline in main
makeDeadline invokes time.Deadline.after
makeDeadline arg milliseconds Int64 waitMs copy
makeDeadline out deadline time.Deadline
makeDeadline ownedBy none
makeDeadline cleanedBy none
makeDeadline borrows none
makeDeadline catch none

makeLines is call
makeLines in main
makeLines invokes pricing.Lines.new
makeLines arg region Region store lend
makeLines out lines pricing.Lines
makeLines ownedBy store
makeLines cleanedBy none
makeLines borrows none
makeLines catch none

appendRow is call
appendRow in main
appendRow invokes pricing.Lines.append
appendRow arg list pricing.Lines lines lendMutable
appendRow arg item pricing.LineItem row copy
appendRow out none
appendRow ownedBy none
appendRow cleanedBy none
appendRow borrows none
appendRow catch none

# Both tasks borrow `lines` from start to join; neither may change it, and main
# may not change it while either runs.

listTask is task
listTask in main
listTask invokes pricing.listTotal
listTask arg lines pricing.Lines lines lend
listTask out listCents Int64
listTask ownedBy none
listTask cleanedBy none
listTask borrows none
listTask catch listError pricing.PricingError

discountTask is task
discountTask rationale "Once the list total has failed, the discount total is cancelled and its outcome no longer matters"
discountTask in main
discountTask invokes pricing.discountTotal
discountTask arg lines pricing.Lines lines lend
discountTask out discountCents Int64
discountTask ownedBy none
discountTask cleanedBy none
discountTask borrows none
discountTask catch discountError pricing.PricingError

printList is call
printList in main
printList invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printList arg value Int64 listCents copy
printList out none
printList ownedBy none
printList cleanedBy none
printList borrows none
printList catch printListError console.WriteError

printDiscount is call
printDiscount in main
printDiscount invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printDiscount arg value Int64 discountCents copy
printDiscount out none
printDiscount ownedBy none
printDiscount cleanedBy none
printDiscount borrows none
printDiscount catch printDiscountError console.WriteError

listDigits is call
listDigits in main
listDigits invokes string.fromInt64
listDigits arg value Int64 listCents copy
listDigits arg region Region store lend
listDigits out listText String
listDigits ownedBy store
listDigits cleanedBy none
listDigits borrows none
listDigits catch none

discountDigits is call
discountDigits in main
discountDigits invokes string.fromInt64
discountDigits arg value Int64 discountCents copy
discountDigits arg region Region store lend
discountDigits out discountText String
discountDigits ownedBy store
discountDigits cleanedBy none
discountDigits borrows none
discountDigits catch none

joinListLabel is call
joinListLabel in main
joinListLabel invokes string.concat
joinListLabel arg left String listLabel lend
joinListLabel arg right String listText lend
joinListLabel arg region Region store lend
joinListLabel out listPart String
joinListLabel ownedBy store
joinListLabel cleanedBy none
joinListLabel borrows none
joinListLabel catch none

joinDiscountLabel is call
joinDiscountLabel in main
joinDiscountLabel invokes string.concat
joinDiscountLabel arg left String listPart lend
joinDiscountLabel arg right String discountLabel lend
joinDiscountLabel arg region Region store lend
joinDiscountLabel out labelledPart String
joinDiscountLabel ownedBy store
joinDiscountLabel cleanedBy none
joinDiscountLabel borrows none
joinDiscountLabel catch none

joinDiscountDigits is call
joinDiscountDigits in main
joinDiscountDigits invokes string.concat
joinDiscountDigits arg left String labelledPart lend
joinDiscountDigits arg right String discountText lend
joinDiscountDigits arg region Region store lend
joinDiscountDigits out reportLine String
joinDiscountDigits ownedBy store
joinDiscountDigits cleanedBy none
joinDiscountDigits borrows none
joinDiscountDigits catch none

lineBytes is call
lineBytes in main
lineBytes invokes string.toBytes
lineBytes arg text String reportLine lend
lineBytes out reportBytes Bytes
lineBytes ownedBy none
lineBytes cleanedBy none
lineBytes borrows reportLine
lineBytes catch none

removeOld is call
removeOld in main
removeOld invokes fs.remove
removeOld arg path String reportPath lend
removeOld out none
removeOld ownedBy none
removeOld cleanedBy none
removeOld borrows none
removeOld catch removeError fs.FileError

openReport is call
openReport in main
openReport invokes fs.create
openReport arg path String reportPath lend
openReport out report fs.FileHandle
openReport ownedBy main
openReport cleanedBy closeReportCleanup
openReport borrows none
openReport catch openError fs.FileError

closeReportCleanup is cleanup
closeReportCleanup in main
closeReportCleanup call closeReport
closeReportCleanup cleans report
closeReportCleanup onFailure trap
closeReportCleanup because "A report that cannot be closed may not be fully written, so the program stops"

closeReport is call
closeReport in main
closeReport invokes fs.close
closeReport arg file fs.FileHandle report give
closeReport out none
closeReport ownedBy none
closeReport cleanedBy none
closeReport borrows none
closeReport catch closeError fs.FileError

writeReport is task
writeReport in main
writeReport invokes fs.write
writeReport arg file fs.FileHandle report lend
writeReport arg bytes Bytes reportBytes lend
writeReport arg deadline time.Deadline deadline copy
writeReport out none
writeReport ownedBy none
writeReport cleanedBy none
writeReport borrows none
writeReport catch writeError fs.FileError

readReport is task
readReport in main
readReport invokes fs.readAll
readReport arg path String reportPath lend
readReport arg region Region store lend
readReport arg maxBytes Int64 readLimit copy
readReport arg deadline time.Deadline deadline copy
readReport out readBytes Bytes
readReport ownedBy store
readReport cleanedBy none
readReport borrows none
readReport catch readError fs.FileError

decodeReport is call
decodeReport in main
decodeReport invokes string.fromBytes
decodeReport arg bytes Bytes readBytes lend
decodeReport arg region Region store lend
decodeReport out readText String
decodeReport ownedBy store
decodeReport cleanedBy none
decodeReport borrows none
decodeReport catch decodeError string.Utf8Error

printReport is call
printReport in main
printReport invokes console.writeLine
printReport arg text String readText lend
printReport out none
printReport ownedBy none
printReport cleanedBy none
printReport borrows none
printReport catch printReportError console.WriteError
